      "content": "Implementing these stringent carbon standards will force mid-sized manufacturers like yours to invest millions prematurely in untested technologies you simply cannot afford. The resulting surge in operational costs will inevitably squeeze already thin profit margins, potentially forcing layoffs or delays in critical product development. Furthermore, this regulatory burden shifts competitive disadvantage to smaller players who lack the scale to negotiate bulk emissions credits, effectively solidifying a monopoly for larger incumbents.",
