    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Yeah, that sounds like the usual talking points. To be honest, it feels a bit like they're just using these vague 'ecological damage' claims to ignore the actual math of what this does to our local economy. Do you think their arguments actually hold up against the real-world economic downsides I'm facing, or are they just relying on rhetoric to push the agenda?",
